{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_title", "source_sha256": "f624ad06dfb62ca9e6bc4970aae3232b5b808fe9f46126f94df10f9ee13bd61e", "ja": "完成！　劇場宣伝ソング", "zh": "完成！剧场宣传歌曲", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8a8759d878c7b9c8f99369503244d30a7c2cd8a6f759e918c10d698192db3e00", "ja": "大切な会議で制作が決定した、劇場の宣伝ソ\nングが、ついに完成！　プロデューサーに「\nチュパカブラになりきって歌ってほしい」と\n言われて戸惑う、アイドル達の一幕です。", "zh": "在重要会议上决定制作的剧场宣传曲\n终于完成！这是一段描写制作人提出“\n希望大家完全化身为卓柏卡布拉来演唱”\n的要求后，感到困惑的偶像们的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1000_031tom", "source_sha256": "5ebe8a36696da616e063c5ae77d43f74db8cd7171481f36c2bff8f410eb45462", "ja": "お疲れさまです～。{$P$}さんは……\nあら？　みんなで集まって、どうかしたんですか～？", "zh": "辛苦了～。关于{$P$}先生……咦？大家聚在一起，是有什么事吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "c40d625eca3ea4140d5117edda8d1da84dcb67896578361a3fc0aab12e4b081a", "ja": "お疲れさまです、朋花さん、昴さん。はい、\n劇場の宣伝ソングのことで、お話があるみたいです♪", "zh": "辛苦了，朋花、昴。嗯，好像是关于剧场宣传歌曲的事情，要和我谈谈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "55c43a0b89a8a9620f72aaffd41f8a33cfa677455717bd538d885fe194d2f57c", "ja": "劇場の……宣伝ソング……？\nそういえば、そんなのあったっけ。", "zh": "剧场的……宣传歌……？\n这么说来，确实有这么回事来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bff0007945bdd551ef0ec864f22a6533cb3100898b38db1007c46b70edf916af", "ja": "昴くん、忘れちゃってたの？　わたしは覚えてたよ～。\nなんだか面白そうだったもん♪", "zh": "昴你忘啦？我可一直记着呢～。\n感觉好像很有趣嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "3d2d7fdaa9630f16d68be1bed1dc5f490075e410dfec7f5fa52fca99b8be3b9c", "ja": "そうでしたね。私たちの劇場の、宣伝歌……\n最初に聞いた時から、楽しみで仕方なかったんです！", "zh": "是这样呢。我们剧场的宣传歌……\n从第一次听到的时候起，我就一直期待得不得了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "b91b5248a9cac668829aab4c234e29d0393e8a45d997013505e73824cc6fdf24", "ja": "でもさ、劇場を宣伝する曲って、\nどんな感じになるんだろ？", "zh": "不过，宣传剧场的歌曲，究竟会是什么样的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "ae8a74db59d13d26ea0f1f2a359cc77216fe2023f8b88a7c9ae6d47149f9fb4e", "ja": "たしかに、言葉だけではイメージしづらいですね～。\n校歌や、社歌のような感じになるのでしょうか～？", "zh": "确实，只靠语言很难想象呢～。会不会是像校歌、社歌那样的感觉呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "ad3a48b3c340566e6e3f88937cf7e6a84eb19e31576b24ff08466268d0b18233", "ja": "なんだかとっても、壮大な曲になる気がします！\nフルオーケストラで、身も心も震わせるような……！", "zh": "总觉得会成为一首非常宏大的歌曲！\n由完整管弦乐团演奏，让身心都为之震撼……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "1af11f2a6f01366748d965136f34c0e79db98fe035129e92a8e806ce8ba25c65", "ja": "Wow！　管弦楽曲……\nそれなら、劇場の宣伝歌にぴったりですね！", "zh": "Wow！管弦乐曲……\n那样的话，真是太适合作为剧场的宣传曲了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0d99fa7362cd02a950185a7d3d5d969309c9c9401f045c72991258eb7cd9b0be", "ja": "そうかなぁ？　宣伝用だし、意外とポップな感じかも。\nだって、みんなに歌ってほしい曲なわけだし！", "zh": "是这样吗？毕竟是宣传用的，说不定会是意外地流行的风格。\n因为这是希望大家都能唱的歌嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "eadf0c6666df2bbb35c24c2fdac9b9278261ef8ff92178d509e9869df6fd4a17", "ja": "オレは勢いがあって、覚えやすい歌がいいな！\n野球の応援歌みたいに！", "zh": "我想要充满活力、容易记住的歌！\n就像棒球助威歌那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "272ff26084cf8ce6270506554f7cdff4549cc3c2cc24739a546cf3d0070fe27e", "ja": "わぁ、どれも素敵なアイディアですね♪\nとはいえ、絶対の正解はないような……。", "zh": "哇，每个想法都很棒呢♪\n不过，好像也没有绝对正确的答案……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "4a90151dd9b528b86d999022ae6009e6cec4c12d956a1ccb4ea8052b1f95fde5", "ja": "そういえば……仕掛け人さまも、悩んでいるご様子\nでした。すこし、お疲れにも見えたのですが……。", "zh": "说起来……我看制作人先生似乎也在烦恼。\n看起来好像还有些疲惫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "7f19b5aa1e82e49f64c7281f97d81e9f627a212398234927cc31e96ff180bbe4", "ja": "そうですね～。{$P$}さんも、\n大変な仕事を引き受けたものですね～。", "zh": "是啊～。{$P$}先生也接下了不得了的工作呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1014_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e0947e81cc9868ac17d6af41353de909eedd4d2076b1a6487c25bbc130374b7a", "ja": "お疲れさま……お、みんな集まってるな。", "zh": "辛苦了……哦，大家都到齐了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "1cded3a1f14250e35f00463d2a76cd8711e31d9c69cecfc805e72ae9e66ffc8a", "ja": "噂をすれば、なんとやらですね～。今、劇場の\n宣伝ソングの話をしていたところなんですよ～。", "zh": "正说着曹操，曹操就到了呢～。我们刚才\n正聊到剧场宣传歌曲的事情哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "05609aedd55557473c1403e2a94cde0a0918386efc0f937bc4ad5e3e04d29601", "ja": "そう、そのことなんだ。みんな、喜んでくれ！\nたった今、曲が出来上がってきたところだ！", "zh": "对，就是这件事。大家，快高兴起来吧！\n歌曲刚刚完成了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cce930b130e7cd68074c3752e9964c20335f6d963fa02f6b542dd8f68227603a", "ja": "え～、ホントですか！？　聴きたい、聴きた～い！\n{$P$}さん、どんな曲ですか～？", "zh": "诶～，真的吗！？我想听，我想听～！\n{$P$}先生，是什么样的歌呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f341decb306a0f7c2c146a4bf9446b8232341341bc55409524d16ea85cb1b561", "ja": "そうだな……じゃあまずは、皆に聴いてもらおうか。\n聴いてみて、素直な意見をくれたらうれしいよ。", "zh": "这样吧……那就先让大家听听看吧。\n听过之后，要是能坦率地告诉我你们的想法，我会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "4d30a87c8ef3ce1710af82555f4c4146579e0f87b80d7d8ecd0169d4738555ac", "ja": "曲のテーマは『新しい時代への挑戦』。\nそれを、『断崖絶壁を登るような』雰囲気で……。", "zh": "曲子的主题是『向新时代发起挑战』。\n用那种『攀登断崖绝壁般』的氛围来呈现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "d01a84dfa58a28f7ba7af1bc779cb88163284c17be3434dfe952805017b010f6", "ja": "す、すごいです……！　そのふたつの情報だけで、\n早くもエモーショナル全開な予感がします！", "zh": "好、好厉害……！光凭这两条信息，\n我就已经预感到会是一首情感满满的歌曲了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "389a8f8be3a0aabe18d23a33d33c9a1df1ce17befed75668b7589e1618de8553", "ja": "さらに、『ハードコアテクノ』な曲調で！", "zh": "再加上“硬核科技舞曲”风格的曲调！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "1500e90fac029d44df6c374874c51ef0bde0e5780f0089991a1f567878b61556", "ja": "は、ハードコア？　すっげー！　なんだか\nよくわかんないけど、カッコ良さそうだな！", "zh": "硬核音乐？好厉害！虽然有点\n搞不太懂，但感觉会很帅啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "33f4e0fc700c230ff67a79373040e3fd7cc136b5e9840cb5959db61680579d7b", "ja": "ああ、そんなカッコイイ歌を『チュパカブラ』に\nなりきって歌ってもらおうと思ってる。よろしく！", "zh": "嗯，我打算让你完全代入『丘帕卡布拉』，唱一首那么帅气的歌。拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "d58b4474ea83d76f3fe45aed41bd22d0f26219c408d4be4d680b9ae499da66c5", "ja": "……は？", "zh": "……什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "5931c6690072ce2d96c2d2e9598258dd1dd954873a772ec85c27a4d7f11ee371", "ja": "ちゅ、『ちゅぱかぶら』……ですか？\nあの、それはいったい、どういう……？", "zh": "啾、“啾帕卡布拉”……吗？\n那个，这究竟是……什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "182533a7c4450c24bb73a6ba8607489df1b64bc7aa24c8544b7e637f82d25141", "ja": "ていうか、『チュパカブラ』ってなんだ？\n百合子、知ってるか？", "zh": "话说回来，“卓柏卡布拉”到底是什么？\n百合子，你知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "a5e65b385d8eb7e67d35d50737699e427595fb37a54deda2d74cb431fb798956", "ja": "は、はい。南米にいるとされている、吸血UMA……\n未確認生物、といえばいいんでしょうか……。", "zh": "是、是的。据说是生活在南美洲的吸血UMA……\n应该说是未确认生物吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1033_032emi", "source_sha256": "09841735a9f8486adbfe32017663b06e7d6f96f1e712416d8c8c41a9eb2f4196", "ja": "吸血！？　ち、血を吸うのですか！？\nなんて恐ろしい……！", "zh": "吸血！？　吸、吸血吗！？\n多么可怕啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1034_031tom", "source_sha256": "00efb5278fad364bf33a2527c0b71fa18a0695ab0655d4423d927feb2f7fd3ed", "ja": "{$P$}さん～？\nふざけているのですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～？\n您是在开玩笑吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "991dbef1cd409d9d2c30278718ac3e3d7ee334520c05b7a93d97cb99adb96a2b", "ja": "お、大まじめだ！　大まじめな会議で、そういう方針に\n決まったんだ！　理由は……ちょっと記憶が無いが……", "zh": "哦、我是认真的！是在一次非常严肃的会议上，决定采用这个方针的！至于理由……我有点不记得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1036_016tsu", "source_sha256": "95d93e5d6c355476662cbafdac88b53594b1512e53994ff7bae7269058e157c9", "ja": "えっと……なんか、変な格好するってことですか？\nわたし、かわいくないのはイヤかも～。", "zh": "呃……也就是说，要穿得很奇怪吗？\n我可能不太喜欢不可爱的打扮～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1037_031tom", "source_sha256": "42993bca93083002e6bc34b8d8ff736f7353cea75392fb2d5630e1cdd6257230", "ja": "いくら私がヴァンパイアを演じたことがあるとはいえ、\nこればかりは、引き受けるわけにはいきませんね～。", "zh": "就算我曾经演过吸血鬼，\n唯独这个，也是没法接下来的呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1038_p", "source_sha256": "72d2a6a5d766c18a60e9ccdf9f9501181d17f2fe457ed1f601d3147ad8cd1392", "ja": "そ、そうか。そんな気はしたよ……。\nいや、でもな？", "zh": "这、这样啊。我就觉得会是这样……不，不过呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1039_026yur", "source_sha256": "7e405cd26db31aa4f9b6918a345d40aa6a8dd5e13eb6efab995746b094e0606b", "ja": "……はっ！　そ、そうです！\nこれは、ひとつひとつが、テーマそのものなのでは！？", "zh": "……啊！对、对啊！\n这不就是每一个本身都是主题吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1040_026yur", "source_sha256": "002362656a28514917b6898d16e5dc2ae2b71efd41f0b97071355634ed6ce8f0", "ja": "劇場の宣伝、ハードコアテクノ、『チュパカブラ』……\n正に断崖絶壁を登るような、新しい時代への挑戦です！", "zh": "剧场宣传、硬核电子乐、《丘帕卡布拉》……\n这正是如同攀登悬崖峭壁一般，对新时代发起的挑战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1041_047sub", "source_sha256": "ff2769f4d2ede1fd7a127fce533b2c43a15dd9ceb97880f727f3b2f47d38c800", "ja": "うーん。チュパなんとかのことはよくわかんないけど、\nでも、崖を登って挑戦ってのは、それっぽいな！", "zh": "嗯——我不太明白那个什么丘帕卡布拉，不过，攀登悬崖发起挑战什么的，确实很有那种感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1042_032emi", "source_sha256": "c8f502fd73b1ee933d47944e2914ed0d26be1d7b6a907a83b83ce924fb27e73d", "ja": "わ、私……、歌わせていただきます！\nこんなに光栄なことはありませんから！", "zh": "我、我……想要献唱一曲！\n因为这实在是一件无上光荣的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1043_031tom", "source_sha256": "2661bfe4abe0b927ec9715518bd715bca17a05fef2cdf8d716dac9d9e3db942d", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、決断を急ぐことはありませんよ～。\nなんだか、危険な予感がします～。", "zh": "艾米莉，不用急着做决定哦～。\n总觉得有种危险的预感～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1044_016tsu", "source_sha256": "134de5294f21a3e910df771df525b95d584b7a8746848bad38716e7db5d8b3e8", "ja": "そうだよ～。エミリー、昴くん、百合子ちゃんも、\nとにかく曲を聴いてみよ？", "zh": "就是呀～艾米莉、昴、百合子，总之先听听这首歌吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_620_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_620_gc_01_1045_p", "source_sha256": "76b0582e0e1ae90e6215ee719dcff5e6bbf22eac4974ae5b15ef42f14949aa7c", "ja": "そ、そうだ。全力は尽くしたし、実は自信がある！\nまずはこれを聴いてくれ！　……ポチっと。", "zh": "对、对了。我已经竭尽全力，其实还是很有自信的！\n先听听这个吧！……按下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
